  "description": "I reviewed 37 former winners. Only one still stand out.",
  "body_html": "<p>Its interesting to see what people consider a “dumpster fire”. A day-trader will consider a -5% dip a terrible day…where an investor will consider it an average weekday. So as we  quickly go through this list of 37 stocks, keep in mind, time frame is critical. My analysis is based on the daily and weekly time frames. I asked for your favorite “dumpster fire” stocks to evaluate which one is most likely to fully recover. </p><p>When I think of a dumpster fire stock, the first requirement is that the price action is below the 200 day moving average. <em><strong>Any stock that has price action below the 200 day moving average is an automatic, firm “NO”. </strong></em>You cannot achieve a local high, 52-week high or an all time high if price is below there. Period. So why buy it?</p><p>That said, these stocks provided were <strong>not </strong>dumpster fires per my strategy:</p><p><span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$UPS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$BE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$INTC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MU&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SYM&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$MRNA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AVGO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$LMND&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$FSLY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ILMN&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> , and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$T&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> </p><h4>I will share my favorite from the above list at the end of the article/video, as some of them are absolutely within investable territory. </h4><p>As much as I preach against buying the dip though, as it is fighting trend, I know some of you just love ❤️ to buy the dip. Here is the full list of tickers up for review and all of them have price action below the 200 day moving average:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"609\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:609,&quot;width&quot;:250,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:13825,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/187646479?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!frKn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F44764008-8ac3-424a-b726-f5517d442c6c_250x609.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>Before reading on: Please LIKE and RE-STACK this. Only way we beat the AI Slop.</h4><p>Now, even though the stock price action is atrocious…even some of my favorite past winning stocks in this list (that we sold off long ago)…there are still some great companies here. Good companies/stocks experience draw downs, sell offs and recessions nonetheless. So we can start with the absolute basics: <strong>Is the company making money?</strong> Yes or no. If a stock is to be successful in the future, it must be bringing in cash. We can measure this just by evaluating if the cash flow has increased annually. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>With this simple parameter, we were able to quickly eliminate over half of the 26 tickers. Some special notes about these eliminated stocks:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Rigetti </strong>we traded for +54%. It was a good run. But it was a pure chart play with a volatility contraction pattern and a narrative pushing it. If you are still clinging to a hope and a dream…let it go!</p></li><li><p><strong>I hate Microstrategy</strong>. Truly hate this company. They are essentially gambling with leverage. Its not if…but when…that explodes in their face. Saylor lost everything in the dot com bubble<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> and it appears he learned nothing. He is a speculative gambler, a loudmouth and his commentary is typically near local tops. Additionally… I wrote this small piece: <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-212669961?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Bitcoin is a terrible investment today</a>. Read that…then note you never hear of Saylor (or Microstrategy) having a huge win…but you do read periodically them take huge losses. Take that as a warning signal. </p></li><li><p><span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$META&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is a pretty popular stock, known to typically recover. But that gap down on 29 October is a huge warning signal. Get price action back near all time highs of $796, before even considering it. </p></li><li><p>I also hate <strong>Chipotle</strong>. My family forces me to eat there often. 🙄 I once researched the commodities (rice, chicken, tomatoes, guacamole, etc). And it costs Chipotle about $.60 cents to make your slop bowl.<strong> SIXTY CENTS</strong>. Yet the prices keep going up and up! In fact the CEO is now talking about raising prices even further to target $100k income earners!<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> Morally I find Chipotle to be a huge scam. That is just a personal rant…the chart looks terrible, for now, so stay away.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png\" width=\"1221\" height=\"655\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:655,&quot;width&quot;:1221,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:118143,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/187646479?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_1221x655.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LaHs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F57e545da-2476-4f6e-a318-cca6d2cf37df_122